# 1. Canonical Protocol & Domain: 301 Permanent Redirect www to apex domain
https://www.kozker.com/* https://kozker.com/:splat 301!
http://www.kozker.com/*  https://kozker.com/:splat 301!
http://kozker.com/*      https://kozker.com/:splat 301!

